
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Director Message";
}
<style>
    @@media(max-width:1100px) {
        .gdgd {
            height: 200px !important;
        }

        .fgfg {
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }
    }
</style>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-12 p-0" style="margin-top: -20px; background: url('https://img.freepik.com/premium-photo/extensive-collection-books-library_868797-8212.jpg') no-repeat center center; background-size: cover; background-attachment:fixed; ">
        <div class="container-fluid" style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center" style="min-height: 300px">
                    <h3 class="display-6 text-white text-uppercase fw-bold">Director’s Message</h3>
                    <div class="d-inline-flex text-white">
                        <p class="m-0 text-uppercase"><a class="text-white" href="/" style="text-decoration:none;">Home</a></p>
                        <i class="fa fa-angle-double-right pt-1 px-3"></i>
                        <p class="m-0 text-uppercase text-light">Director’s Message</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="py-5" style="background-color: #f8f9fa;">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <!-- Image Section -->
            <div class="col-lg-4 mb-4 mb-lg-0 text-center my-auto mt-5">
                <img src="/Content/recp/img/YNS.jpeg" class="img-fluid rounded shadow" style="max-height: 400px; border:4px solid #0747ae;" alt="Director">
                <div class="mt-3">
                    <h4 class=" fw-bold speak-text mb-1 " style="color:#0747ae;">Prof Yogendra Singh</h4>
                    <hr style="border:1px solid black; margin-top:5px; margin-bottom:3px; width:95%; margin:0 auto;" />
                    <p class="mb-0 speak-text text-dark fw-bold">Director of Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh</p>
                    <hr style="border:1px solid black; margin-top:5px; margin-bottom:3px; width:95%; margin:0 auto;"/>
                    <p style="color:black;font-weight:900;">Email: <a href="mailto:director@recp.ac.in">director@recp.ac.in</a> and <a href="mailto:recpratapgarh@gmail.com">recpratapgarh@gmail.com</a></p>                
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Message Section -->
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3" style="color:#0747ae !important; font-size:22px;">Director’s Message</h4>
                <hr style="border-bottom:1px solid black;">
                <p class="text-dark" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 34px; font-size: 16px;">
                    It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to Rajkiya Engineering College Pratapgarh, a state funded government engineering college, started in the academic session 2023-24 by the Government of Uttar Pradesh. The college presently offers four undergraduate programs in Computer Science and Engineering (CSE), Electrical Engineering (EE), Civil Engineering (CE), and Mechanical Engineering (ME) each with an intake of 60 whereas their curriculums are carefully designed to meet current academic and industry standards.
                    During its formative phase, the college is temporarily operating from the campus of Kamla Nehru Institute of Technology (KNIT), Sultanpur and an associated college of Dr APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University Uttar Pradesh, Lucknow. This collaboration ensures that our academic practices align with established quality benchmarks while the permanent campus at Pratapgarh is being developed.
                    With extensive experience in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Vision and Data Science, I firmly believe that the future of engineering education must be interdisciplinary, research-oriented, and closely integrated with real-world applications. At REC Pratapgarh, our academic vision is rooted in this belief - combining strong theoretical foundations with hands-on learning, collaborative research, and meaningful industry engagement.
                    We are committed to establishing:
                 


                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-12 mt-2">
                <ul class="text-dark" style="list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify; line-height: 34px; font-size: 16px;">
                    <li>
                        State-of-the-art Laboratories and Smart Classrooms – Equipped with advanced tools for design, development, analysis and diagnostics across all disciplines.
                    </li>
                    <li>A rigorous, Outcome-Based Education (OBE) system in line with AICTE and NBA/NAAC guidelines, to ensure students gain measurable skills and competencies.</li>
                    <li>A strong emphasis on faculty development and research, encouraging innovation, publications, and advanced technical mentorship.</li>
                    <li>Active industry-academia partnerships, facilitating expert talks, internships and training, and live projects in areas like smart infrastructure, renewable energy, healthcare, embedded systems, IoT, and AI applications.</li>
                    <li>An ecosystem that supports entrepreneurship, innovation, and career excellence, preparing students for higher studies, competitive exams, and leadership roles in the technology world.</li>
                    <li>Above all, REC Pratapgarh is dedicated to fostering an inclusive and equitable environment that empowers every student to grow in knowledge, skill, and opportunity.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="text-dark" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 34px; font-size: 16px;">
                    Our objective is to develop REC Pratapgarh into a center of excellence in public quality technical education, producing engineers who are not only technically skilled but also ethically responsible and socially aware.
                    As we progress on this exciting journey, I warmly welcome students, educators, researchers, and industry leaders to collaborate with us in building a vibrant, future-ready technical Institution.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
   
</section>

